It reminds me the phenomenon of moon's influence:
If anybody comes and say
"When there is full moon, I can't sleep"
everybody will have its own rule:
"Oh yes, I noticed too that : When A, there is B"

But did you ever wondered why there is no rule like :
	o "When there is full moon, I sleep very well"
		It is quite easy to see that it's just because 
		when you sleep, you really do not wonder how 
		is the moon !

	o And no rule like : "When moon is 19.35% full, I can't sleep"
		It's just because when you wake up, the 
		19.35% full moon is not really remindable !... So you 
		go back to bed, having noticed nothing.

So, the only thing people notices is:
"When there is full moon and I can't sleep, I can't sleep"
which is like :
"When A and B, there is B"

I am so often surprised by the amazing rate of such ways of thinking.
Most of our believes are based on such rules !...

For example, I am sure that any of you could be a very good soothsayer:
just say to anybody :
"Be aware ! The facts F1,F2,F3,F4,F5... will happen to YOU"

He will look for those facts, and as soon as one of them happens,
you can be sure that he will notice it. You only made those facts
noticeable.
Now, if one of those facts happens really (how good you are!), he will 
only wonder how you guessed it. Of course, if the other facts never 
happen, he will soon forget them... So, he will sooner or later
look at you as a very good soothsayer.

But now, imagine you are really bad in such a job, and you guessed
nothing (it can happen). Then go and do the same predictions to another Lambda.
And repeat until there is one fact that happens. Those who have had no 
good prediction will think you are not a good soothsayer and will go and see 
another one. But the lucky Lambda will do advertising for you, so there will be
people coming in order to have your wonderful predictions.

And it is so easier to do predictions to people waiting for them...

After many years, if someone doesn't believe in you, just show the
hundreds of lucky Lambdas, for whom you made good predictions. You can
be sure that all those ones are the best advertisers you can have !

As Alphonse Alais said :
"Why should soothsayers be the only ones to always say false things!"

If only we could stop those kind of believes !



